  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - ...Hermano.
  - Don't look at me like that. I know. I know what the paper says.
  - Eight years. They sent me back with a plastic bag and a bus ticket. I haven't
    seen Abuela since.
  - "Jos\xE9 says she's sick. Jos\xE9 says she asks for me. She thinks I'm in Houston.
    I let her think it."
  - I still have her rosary. The one she gave me at the bus station. I want to put
    it back in her hands myself.
  - One car. One day. Nobody has to know. Please, hermano.
  lineIfApproved: "...Gracias, hermano. Don't tell Jos\xE9. He'd cry. He cries at
    everything."
  lineIfRejected: "Est\xE1 bien. You do your job, hermano. ...I'll find another way."
  lineIfImprisoned: Hermano?! ...Okay. Okay. Tell her I'm in Houston.
